      "writtenOn": "2014-03-25T23:12:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm... researching upstream python-ldap indicates the parameter was added in their CVS revision 1.117 on 3/31/2011, just shy of 3 years ago. Looks like that change would have appeared in the 2.3.13 release dated 6/2/2011, 2 3/4 years ago. So it\u0027s been a while. What release do you have? FWIW the test-requirements specify 2.3.13. So as far as I can tell this should be o.k.\n\nIt\u0027s not a big deal though, if we have to we can just let this parameter default, I don\u0027t see an immediate use for it but if we can export the same API we should.",
